\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Included noise contributions after ordered, varying-arm TDI~2 and clock correction. The existing black curve includes independent Rb-model board jitter in its quadrature sum. This timing assumption does not represent the shared-reference setup; its differential timing residual remains unmeasured. The figure is retained pending regeneration with the board scenario separated from the component sum. The calculation uses the changing delays and constant frequency plan of Appendix~\ref {app:noise_parameters}. The dashed reference is the OMS-plus-acceleration model propagated as four independent equivalent link noises. Delay-implementation residuals are excluded, so the sum is not a sensitivity prediction for the assembled testbed.}}{14}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:total_tdi2_noise}{{4}{14}{Included noise contributions after ordered, varying-arm TDI~2 and clock correction. The existing black curve includes independent Rb-model board jitter in its quadrature sum. This timing assumption does not represent the shared-reference setup; its differential timing residual remains unmeasured. The figure is retained pending regeneration with the board scenario separated from the component sum. The calculation uses the changing delays and constant frequency plan of Appendix~\ref {app:noise_parameters}. The dashed reference is the OMS-plus-acceleration model propagated as four independent equivalent link noises. Delay-implementation residuals are excluded, so the sum is not a sensitivity prediction for the assembled testbed}{figure.4}{}}
